{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfumJk61EWgkPQy8XnNpH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No, not by default. Inline projects in `test.projects` do not inherit options from the root config. Each project is treated as an isolated config, so you only get what you define in that project (or what's in a config file it points to).\n\nTo share options, set `extends: true` on the inline project. This makes it merge with the root config (plugins, `resolve.alias`, `test` options, etc.). Without it, the project starts from scratch. A few options are root-only and can't be set per-project, such as `coverage`, `reporters`, and `resolveSnapshotPath`.\n\nExample:\n\n```ts\nexport default defineConfig({\n  test: {\n    globals: true,\n    projects: [\n      { extends: true, test: { name: 'unit' } },  // inherits globals\n      { test: { name: 'e2e' } },                  // does not\n    ],\n  },\n})\n```\n\nI'm answering from memory of the Vitest docs rather than checking the version installed here, so confirm against your version if it matters."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2248,"cache_read_input_tokens":535,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2248},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"29ecac3f-9f77-4c13-96ab-68fe0187d7d0","uuid":"6434cd20-d7ae-404d-a8a7-0af21315f4e8","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:47:23.643Z","request_id":"req_011CfumJju6yUrs2VWNaRBv7"}
